§ `Article 10, waiting periods`

§§ `Article 10, the definition and where it is counted from`

-- src:492 | Điều 10: Thời gian chờ
-- src:493 | Là khoảng thời gian mà Người được bảo hiểm không được hưởng quyền lợi bảo hiểm, bao
-- src:494 | gồm cả những trường hợp quá trình điều trị kéo dài, thời điểm phát sinh rủi ro hoặc bắt đầu
-- src:495 | điều trị nằm trong thời gian chờ, nhưng thời điểm kết thúc của đợt điều trị này nằm ngoài
-- src:496 | thời gian chờ quy định. Thời gian chờ được tính liên tục kể từ ngày Người được bảo hiểm bắt
-- src:497 | đầu tham gia tại hợp đồng bảo hiểm đầu tiên tại Bảo hiểm Tasco, hoặc ngày khôi phục hiệu
-- src:498 | lực Hợp đồng/Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm gần nhất, hoặc Quyền lợi bảo hiểm (cho phần tăng
-- src:499 | thêm), lấy ngày nào đến sau.
-- A waiting period is time in which the insured has no benefit, including treatment that began or a
-- risk that arose inside it and ended outside it. So both the day the risk arose and the day
-- treatment began must be out of it. Counted from the LATEST of: the start of the first contract
-- (of the unbroken chain of renewals, Article 5; fork F28), the most recent reinstatement, and,
-- for an increased benefit, the day of the increase (the start of this contract).
-- A waiting period of N days has run on the day N days after the day it is counted from: day 0
-- is the first day of the period (fork F29).
GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 10, the waiting period is counted from` c MEANS
    `the later of` (`Article 10, the start of continuous participation` c)
                   (c's `the history`'s `date of the most recent reinstatement`)

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 10, the start of continuous participation` c MEANS
    IF   `Article 5, the cover is continuous` c
    THEN c's `the history`'s `start of the insured's continuous participation`
    ELSE c's `the contract`'s `start date`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      m IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the later of` d m MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN NOTHING THEN d
    WHEN JUST e  THEN IF e AT LEAST d THEN e ELSE d

GIVEN `days` IS A NUMBER
      `from` IS A DATE
      c      IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a waiting period of` `days` `counted from` `from` `has run for` c MEANS
        c's `date of the insured event` AT LEAST `from` PLUS `days`
    AND c's `date treatment began`      AT LEAST `from` PLUS `days`

§§ `Article 10.1, the table`

-- src:504 | 10.1 Quy định thời gian chờ:
-- src:506 | TT Rủi ro được bảo hiểm Hợp đồng dưới 100 người Hợp đồng nhóm trên 100 người
-- src:508 | 1 Tai nạn Không áp dụng Không áp dụng
-- src:509 | 365 ngày
-- src:510 | Nằm viện điều trị bệnh đặc biệt,
-- src:511 | 2 365 ngày (hoặc theo thỏa thuận tại Hợp
-- src:512 | bệnh có sẵn
-- src:513 | đồng bảo hiểm)
-- src:514 | 30 ngày
-- src:515 | 3 Bệnh thông thường 30 ngày (hoặc theo thỏa thuận tại Hợp
-- src:516 | đồng bảo hiểm)
-- src:518 | Tử vong, thương tật toàn bộ vĩnh
-- src:519 | 4 viễn do bệnh có sẵn, bệnh đặc biệt, 365 ngày 365 ngày
-- src:520 | thai sản
-- src:522 | 90 ngày
-- src:523 | 5 Biến chứng Thai sản 90 ngày (hoặc theo thỏa thuận tại Hợp
-- src:524 | đồng bảo hiểm)
-- src:525 | 270 ngày
-- src:526 | 6 Sinh đẻ 270 ngày (hoặc theo thỏa thuận tại Hợp
-- src:527 | đồng bảo hiểm)
-- Two columns: contracts of under 100 persons, and group contracts of over 100 persons. A contract
-- of exactly 100 persons is in neither, and is declined where the columns differ (fork F30;
-- NOTES.md, finding X1).
GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A `A column of the waiting-period table`
`Article 10.1, the column for` c MEANS
    BRANCH IF c's `the contract`'s `number of persons insured` LESS THAN 100 THEN `contracts of under 100 persons`
           IF c's `the contract`'s `number of persons insured` EQUALS 100    THEN `no column for a contract of exactly 100 persons`
           IF c's `the contract`'s `a group contract`                        THEN `group contracts of over 100 persons`
           OTHERWISE `no column for a contract of over 100 persons that is not a group contract`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no column for a contract of exactly 100 persons` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 10.1 has a column for contracts of under 100 persons and one for group contracts of over 100 persons, and none for a contract of exactly 100"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no column for a contract of over 100 persons that is not a group contract` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 10.1's column for more than 100 persons is for group contracts, and this contract of more than 100 persons is not one"

-- Which row: by the cause, the benefit, and the illness or maternity event.
--   accident                                   -> row 1
--   illness, death (I.1)                       -> row 4 if a special disease or pre-existing, else row 3
--   illness, hospitalisation or surgery (III)  -> row 2 if a special disease or pre-existing, else row 3
--   maternity, death (I.1)                     -> row 4
--   maternity, III: complication / childbirth  -> row 5 / row 6; other maternity care: no row
-- Row 2 says "hospitalisation"; a surgery for the same disease is read into it (fork F31). Row 4
-- also names total permanent disability from illness, which no benefit pays (finding X16).
GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A `A row of the waiting-period table`
`Article 10.1, the row for` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c's `cause`
    WHEN `an accident` THEN `row 1, accident`
    WHEN `an illness`  THEN
        IF `special or pre-existing` c
        THEN IF   c's `benefit claimed` EQUALS `I.1 death from illness, sickness or maternity`
             THEN `row 4, death or total permanent disability from a pre-existing condition, a special disease or maternity`
             ELSE `row 2, hospitalisation for a special disease or a pre-existing condition`
        ELSE `row 3, ordinary illness`
    WHEN `maternity`   THEN
        IF   c's `benefit claimed` EQUALS `I.1 death from illness, sickness or maternity`
        THEN `row 4, death or total permanent disability from a pre-existing condition, a special disease or maternity`
        ELSE CONSIDER c's `maternity event`
             WHEN JUST `a pregnancy complication` THEN `row 5, pregnancy complications`
             WHEN JUST `childbirth`               THEN `row 6, childbirth`
             WHEN JUST `other maternity care`     THEN `no row for maternity care that is neither a complication nor childbirth`
             WHEN NOTHING                         THEN `the claim does not say which maternity event it is`

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`special or pre-existing` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c's `the illness`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the claim does not say what the illness is`
    WHEN JUST i  THEN i's `a special disease` OR `Article 2.12, a pre-existing condition` i

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no row for maternity care that is neither a complication nor childbirth` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 10.1 has rows for pregnancy complications and for childbirth, and none for other maternity care"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the claim does not say which maternity event it is` MEANS
    REFUSE "the waiting period for maternity turns on the maternity event, and the claim does not name one"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the claim does not say what the illness is` MEANS
    REFUSE "the waiting period for an illness turns on whether it is a special disease or pre-existing, and the claim does not say"

-- The days, as the table prints them. "Không áp dụng" (not applicable) is 0 days. Rows 1 and 4 print
-- the same figure in both columns, so they are answered without asking which column applies (a
-- contract of exactly 100 persons included). In the column for group contracts of over 100
-- persons, rows 2, 3, 5 and 6 add "or as agreed in the contract".
GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 10.1, the waiting period in days for` c MEANS
    CONSIDER `Article 10.1, the row for` c
    WHEN `row 1, accident` THEN 0
    WHEN `row 4, death or total permanent disability from a pre-existing condition, a special disease or maternity` THEN 365
    WHEN `row 2, hospitalisation for a special disease or a pre-existing condition` THEN
        `by the column` 365 (c's `the contract`'s `waiting periods agreed`'s `row 2, hospitalisation for a special disease or a pre-existing condition`) c
    WHEN `row 3, ordinary illness` THEN
        `by the column` 30 (c's `the contract`'s `waiting periods agreed`'s `row 3, ordinary illness`) c
    WHEN `row 5, pregnancy complications` THEN
        `by the column` 90 (c's `the contract`'s `waiting periods agreed`'s `row 5, pregnancy complications`) c
    WHEN `row 6, childbirth` THEN
        `by the column` 270 (c's `the contract`'s `waiting periods agreed`'s `row 6, childbirth`) c

-- Rows 2, 3, 5 and 6: the table's days in the under-100 column; in the over-100 column, those days
-- or the number the contract agrees.
GIVEN `the table's days` IS A NUMBER
      `the agreed days`  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      c                  IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`by the column` `the table's days` `the agreed days` c MEANS
    CONSIDER `Article 10.1, the column for` c
    WHEN `contracts of under 100 persons`      THEN `the table's days`
    WHEN `group contracts of over 100 persons` THEN `or as agreed` `the table's days` `the agreed days`

GIVEN `the table's days`  IS A NUMBER
      `the agreed days`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`or as agreed` `the table's days` `the agreed days` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the agreed days`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the table's days`
    WHEN JUST d  THEN d

§§ `Article 10.2, the supplementary clause for group contracts of over 100 persons`

-- src:531 | 10.2 Điều khoản bổ sung – Điều chỉnh thời gian chờ
-- src:532 | Căn cứ vào kết quả thẩm định rủi ro của đối tượng khách hàng, Bảo hiểm Tasco có thể áp dụng
-- src:533 | điều khoản bổ sung điều chỉnh thời gian chờ đối với Hợp đồng nhóm trên 100 người trong
-- src:534 | trường hợp nằm viện điều trị ốm đau, bệnh tật, thai sản và phải được quy định cụ thể trên Hợp
